1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:22,999
I offer countless thanks to Jesus and my Mother Mary. Beyond gratitude, throughout this entire lifetime I remain indebted to my Jesus and my Mother Mary.

2
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,999
The first time I came here was in February. I am here to speak about the healing of my mother’s illness.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,999
The first time I came here was in February. The reason for coming here for the first time was that my mother had a rare illness.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,999
We do not know the name of the illness, nor do we know what illness it is. There is no medicine for it.

5
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,999
What was said about the illness is that it is a mental disorder.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,999
She was always confused. At times, she would not remember anything she said, would not remember anything she did, would not know what to say, and would not know what to do.

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:01,999
She could not eat food; the food would not go down. Likewise, my mother would not even swallow her saliva.

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,999
For 22 years, she has been taking one medicine. She could eat food only because of that medicine. If the medicine was missed even for one day, she would not eat.

9
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,999
Even when saliva came, she would spit it out. That was the kind of illness she had.

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:19,999
Even today, doctors have not been able to identify what the illness is.

11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,999
Without knowing what the illness was, we continued in great distress, giving that medicine continuously for 22 years.

12
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:32,999
By the time February came, my mother fell sick again. She lost her memory completely and stopped eating.

13
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:40,999
For one week, she did not eat anything. Even when saliva came, she kept spitting it out. Then our aunt (my mother’s elder sister) said for the first time,

14
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:49,999
"Daughter, let us take your mother and go near Mother Mary at Kreupasanam. Let us take her there and see. This is the last way left; there is no other way.”

15
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:54,999
Even when we take her to doctors, whenever they examine her, they send her back saying there is no illness at all.

16
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,999
So we thought, let us go and try this as well.

17
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:04,999
The one we call our aunt is my mother’s twin sister. They look exactly alike, are the same age, and were born with only a five-minute difference.

18
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:14,999
It was this aunt who brought us here for the first time. On the day we came, I came thinking that my mother would receive Father’s laying on of hands.

19
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:19,999
But when we came here and enquired at the office, we came to know that only those who have taken the Covenant receive Father’s laying on of hands.

20
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,999
Hearing that, we were saddened.

21
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:30,999
I somehow brought my mother and made her sit here in front of Mother Mary. After she had been sitting there for a while, suddenly my mother felt dizzy.

22
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:39,999
Right there, where she was sitting, she collapsed and fell unconscious. Everyone around started asking, “What happened? What happened?” Since it was not possible to explain everything in detail to everyone,

23
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:43,999
I said she felt dizzy and fell down.

24
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:47,999
Then a woman nearby gave me a bottle of water and said, “Child, give her water, give her water.”

25
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:52,999
At that moment my hands and legs were trembling; I did not know what to do.

26
00:02:53,000 --> 00:03:05,999
After about two minutes, my mother slowly opened her eyes and said to me, “Daughter, it feels like my illness has reduced. It feels like something has left my body.”

27
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:11,999
I could not understand what my mother was saying. I just told her, “Nothing like that, mother. Pray.” For about five more minutes,

28
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:17,999
the two of us stood there together, both of us in tears, our eyes overflowing.

29
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:26,999
Because this was the last option. There was nowhere else to go, no other medicine. Even the medicine she had been taking was no longer reacting in her body.

30
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:33,999
After taking that medicine continuously, it had stopped working in her body. There was no other medicine. That was the last medicine.

31
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:41,999
At that moment, my aunt said, “We have brought a packet of rice with us. Let us also take that. Maybe some miracle will happen.” She said,

32
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:47,999
“Maybe she will eat it right there in Mother’s presence,” and we had kept a packet of rice with us.

33
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:52,999
After the prayers were over, we moved aside and sat on the roadside.

34
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:57,999
Then my mother said, “I am very hungry. Give me rice.” Immediately,

35
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:08,999
we opened the rice packet and gave it to my mother. I can call it a miracle—my mother ate that rice quickly, taking handful after handful, without any difficulty.

36
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:15,999
When I saw that, my eyes filled with tears, because we had never seen her enjoy eating food like that.

37
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:30,999
After so many years, after all these years, seeing my mother eating rice with such enjoyment, I could not even believe that such a miracle had happened.

38
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:37,999
After that, we went home praying. It was only after this that I came and took the Covenant.

39
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:47,999
I first took the Covenant on April 22, 2025. After taking the Covenant, I tried to follow the Covenant matters and conditions as much as I could.

40
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:58,999
After that, my mother was able to eat food. From then on, she has had no difficulty at all in eating any kind of food. However, she was still being given medicine.

41
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:07,999
After that, I renewed the Covenant again on October 1. Even after renewing it, my mother was still spitting out saliva.

42
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:14,999
The habit of spitting saliva was still present. What my mother used to say was that if she swallowed saliva, she would die.

43
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:22,999
We do not know whether it was because of some demonic affliction or evil influences, or why such a rare illness happened. Nothing is known.

44
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:26,999
But my mother kept saying that if she swallowed saliva, she would die.

45
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:33,999
One day I told her, “There is nothing like that. Try swallowing once.” When she swallowed, her whole body started shaking and she fell to the ground.

46
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:40,999
Then I understood that she was not doing it intentionally; she was unable to do it, and that is why she had not been swallowing.

47
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:47,999
At that moment, we took a decision. A strong desire arose in my heart that my mother needed Father’s laying on of hands.

48
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:52,999
So we came here on the 3rd of this month—December 3rd.

49
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:58,999
We received permission to see Father. Then Father’s laying-on-of-hands prayer was conducted.

50
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:10,999
We came here on the 3rd and made my mother sit to the side. When her turn came, Father clearly traced three crosses on my mother’s throat.

51
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:15,999
I do not know how Father understood exactly what my mother’s illness was.

52
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:25,999
But Father looked at my mother’s throat and traced three crosses there. At that very moment, my mother began to swallow the saliva that came into her mouth.

53
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:32,999
From that moment until now, my mother has not spat even once. She swallows all the saliva in her mouth.

54
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:39,999
Till now, she has not experienced any problem, nor has she had any mental disturbances or distress.

55
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:50,999
Likewise, at that same time, when we went home that day, my mother asked, “Daughter, should I take the medicine now?” I said,

56
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:58,999
“No, mother. You do not need to take the medicine anymore. We have nothing greater than Father’s laying on of hands.” “There is no medicine in this world greater than that.

57
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:04,999
So mother, you don’t need to take the medicine. From today, let us stop that medicine.” From December 3rd onwards,

58
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:08,999
that medicine was stopped. From then until today, she has not taken that medicine.

59
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:14,999
She is moving forward now without any medicine at all. Until now, there has been no problem. My mother is moving forward happily.

60
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:21,999
If my Mother Mary and my Jesus had not held our hands at that time, today our mother would never have been with us.

61
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:31,999
How long can a person live without eating food? Not even one month is possible. If, in such a situation, my Mother Mary had not held our hands,

62
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:41,999
today, we would never have had the person we call our mother with us. Therefore, we firmly believe that this great blessing was given to us by Mother Mary and Jesus.

63
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:48,999
For that, I remain indebted to my Mother Mary and my Jesus throughout this entire lifetime.

64
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:56,999
That is my first testimony. My second testimony is this: I was studying a course for a degree examination.

65
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:07,999
I had taken B.Com with Computer Applications, but because I had a desire to join the Corporation, I was also studying for another degree examination related to that.

66
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:15,999
To get the hall ticket, I went to the college the previous day and collected it. At that time, the college did not tell me anything.

67
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:20,999
They did not say that anything else was required. They simply handed over the hall ticket.

68
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:25,999
The next day, my exam was at 1:30. I reached the college at 12:30.

69
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:37,999
After reaching there, I was checking my hall ticket and looking for the room number—checking the notice board and matching the number with my hall ticket.

70
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:42,999
At that time, two students came behind me and said, “Sister, why is there no photo on your hall ticket?

71
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:50,999
A photo must be pasted, and it must be attested by a government staff member.” When they said that,

72
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:53,999
the time was already 12:30, and my exam was to start at 1:30.

73
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:59,999
When I heard that, I panicked. I looked at other students’ hall tickets—everyone had a photo pasted and attested. Only mine did not.

74
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:08,999
Immediately, I ran to the office. I went there and asked the staff and the principal whether a photo and attestation were required,

75
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,999
and whether I would be allowed to write the exam without it.

76
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:15,999
They said that it was not possible. If there was no photo, I would not be allowed to write the exam.

77
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:20,999
They said the photo must be attested; otherwise, I would have to wait and write the exam only next year.

78
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:25,999
At that moment, I was deeply distressed. My hands and legs were trembling, and I completely lost hope of writing the exam.

79
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:30,999
I had gone well prepared, but when I suddenly heard this, I was shaken. I had no time—my exam was at 1:30.

80
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:34,999
I did not have a photo with me, and there was very little time left.

81
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:39,999
I needed to take a photo and paste it, but I did not have one. Trembling, I stood near the college gate,

82
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:43,999
waiting for a bus to go to a place where I could take a photo.

83
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:49,999
I stood there waiting for a bus to go to the photo studio, but not a single bus came. That route hardly had bus service.

84
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:54,999
I stood there for nearly ten minutes. Suddenly, an auto-rickshaw came in front of me.

85
00:09:55,000 --> 00:10:02,999
At that moment, my heart told me to signal with my hand. I quickly signaled, stopped the auto, and stood in front of the driver.

86
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:08,999
Seeing me standing there crying, with tears in my eyes and trembling, he asked, “What happened, child?” I told him that my exam would start at 1:30,

87
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:13,999
that my hall ticket did not have a photo pasted or attested, and that I would not be allowed to write the exam without it.

88
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:17,999
He told me, “Get in.” I quickly got into the auto rickshaw.

89
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:25,999
He took me straight to a photo studio. I took the photo there, and within five minutes, they quickly gave me four photos.

90
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:34,999
At that moment, I did not have money to pay. I had gone out carrying only my bus fare. I had no other money with me.

91
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:43,999
The person at the studio said, “You can pay later.” That brother too said, “Pay after you finish your exam. You can come back and pay,” which is another blessing. From there,

92
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:49,999
I went straight to a government school. At the government school, I got the photo attested by the principal.

93
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:57,999
Then the same auto driver brought me back and dropped me near the college gate before 1:15 and took me right up to the exam hall.

94
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:06,999
What can I say—I wrote that exam with joy. I had thought that I would have to return without writing the exam.

95
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:16,999
I never imagined that so many things could happen before 1:30. That route is one where even buses rarely come; sometimes you have to wait for an hour for a bus.

96
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:22,999
It is a place where you cannot even get an auto easily. I fully believe that my Mother Mary came before me in the form of that auto driver.

97
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:29,999
My Mother knew even better than I did what I needed, and she came and did everything for me.

98
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:34,999
I firmly believe that if my Mother Mary had not come there at that moment, I would never have been able to write that exam.

99
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:38,999
I always believe it as a great blessing given to me by my Mother Mary.

100
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:45,999
That is my second testimony. If I speak about the third one, it is about a drainage pipe at our house.

101
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:54,999
The drainage pipe runs under the road, along the side of the main road where people pass. That pipe got blocked once.

102
00:11:55,000 --> 00:12:06,999
When it got blocked, the dirty water started flowing out onto the road. People came to our house and said, “It seems your pipe has burst. There is a terrible smell.” They said,

103
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:16,999
“We need to walk through this road. You must fix this drainage problem as soon as possible.” We did not even know that our pipe had burst.

104
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:20,999
It was only when people came and told us that we came to know it was our house pipe.

105
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:30,999
That very day, my father asked several people to fix it. But since it was a drainage pipe, everyone said that municipal permission was needed.

106
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:34,999
Because of that, no one was willing to come forward to do the work.

107
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:39,999
We were distressed and prayed to Mother Mary. When we asked one man, he agreed to come.

108
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:47,999
The previous night, we had prayed with the blessed salt, crying before Mother Mary, saying, “Mother, please let it be fixed tomorrow itself.” Otherwise,

109
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:55,999
people would keep coming to our house and complaining that they cannot walk or even stand on the road because of our pipe.

110
00:12:56,000 --> 00:13:05,999
After praying with the blessed salt in that place, next day, a man came and said, “We will fix this; there is no problem.” That man was not afraid.

111
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:09,999
Everyone else had stepped back saying the municipality would create problems.

112
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:16,999
But for some reason, that man came forward and said, “It’s okay, I will do it.” He worked with great effort.

113
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:24,999
What had happened was that a large stone had gotten stuck inside the pipe, causing the blockage.

114
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:30,999
With great difficulty, he removed that stone. From that day until now, that blockage has never occurred again.

115
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:39,999
This also happened through the blessing of the Holy Mother. In this way, our Mother Mary has given us so many small and big blessings.

116
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:45,999
From the day we placed our hands in Mother’s hands, she has given us only blessings. Whatever difficulty we tell her, she resolves it for us at that very moment.

117
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:51,999
There are many such experiences, but I cannot say all of them here now, so I have shared only the most important ones.

118
00:13:52,000 --> 00:14:01,999
Our Mother is always with us, holding our hands and leading us every day. We move forward each day calling upon our Mother again and again.

119
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:09,999
I remain indebted throughout this lifetime to my Mother Mary and to the Holy Son. A thousand thanks, a crore thanks, for giving my mother back to us.

120
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:21,999
A thousand thanks, endless thanks, I offer to Mother Mary. Likewise, to say a few words of thanks about my mother’s healing— I do not know how my mother should thank her.

121
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:28,999
Every day, I sit and pray to my Mother. There is not a single day when I do not pray to her.

122
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:36,999
For enabling me to swallow saliva, for giving me water to drink, for enabling me to eat food, and for helping me stop the medicine,

123
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:42,999
I offer countless thanks to my Mother Mary and to the Holy Son

124
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:53,999
I have only one desire in my life—that I may bow before my Mother and pray to her until death. Mother, may you always grant me that one thing.

125
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:56,999
That is my constant prayer.

126
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:03,999
My name is Lekha. I am her younger sister. I had offered an intention for my mother’s illness to be healed.

127
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:11,999
Now that my mother’s illness has been healed, the medicine has been stopped, and she is able to eat well, I offer crores of thanks to Jesus and Mother Mary.

128
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:18,999
As an act of mercy, I used to distribute Mother Mary’s newspaper by going from house to house.

129
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:29,999
I have fear to distribute it at bus stands or similar places, because many people step on it. Some do not even care to read it and trample it.

130
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:39,999
When I saw that, it caused me great pain. So sometimes I would take the newspaper back and place it somewhere safe where no one would step on it.

131
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:47,999
Therefore, I give the newspaper by entering homes and placing it directly into people’s hands.

132
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:53,999
While distributing it, I also share about my mother’s healing and what happened.

133
00:15:54,000 --> 00:16:03,999
In the same way, if anyone stretches out their hand to me, I give whatever money I have with me at that time. Whatever little I have, I give.

134
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:07,999
In this way, I have also been able to grow a lot spiritually.

135
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:15,999
In the beginning, my mind was extremely troubled. We lived with a deeply wounded heart, always filled with sorrow because of my mother’s condition.

136
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:23,999
My mother’s illness began when I was in the fifth standard. From that time onwards, I grew up seeing this illness every day until now.

137
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:35,999
We didn't know what a happy life is, but only now—after my mother’s illness has been healed—my heart has opened up. Only now am I able to truly feel joy and smile.

138
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:40,999
Along with that, I have also desired to grow a lot spiritually.

139
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:48,999
It is only through the blessing of Father’s laying on of hands that my mother is now able to swallow her saliva.

140
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:54,999
I always pray to Mother Mary that no harm should ever come to Father—not even a thorn should pierce his hands.

141
00:16:55,000 --> 00:17:01,999
Because through Father’s laying on of hands, many more children still have to rise up and be healed.

142
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:07,999
Therefore, with a full heart, I always pray to Mother Mary that Father may remain in good health and long life.

143
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:16,999
I pray that Mother Mary may always bless Father. Isaiah 41:10 — “Do not fear, for I am with you; do not be dismayed,

144
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:36,999
for I am your God. I will strengthen you and help you; I will uphold you with my victorious right hand.” We were listening to the deeply covenant-rooted life testimony of this daughter named Lakshmi,

145
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:45,999
She shared how great trust in the Holy Mother became a blessing for her family.

146
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:55,999
This family first came to pray at the sanctuary of Mother Mary because of the mother’s very severe and painful illness.

147
00:17:56,000 --> 00:18:08,999
As Lakshmi pointed out, when they brought her mother and made her sit in front of the church, the mother collapsed to the ground and became extremely uncomfortable.

148
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:14,999
But after a short while, she stood up and asked for food—this is the testimony.

149
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:22,999
A sister who had been suffering without eating any food and unable even to swallow water, living only in illness and distress,

150
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:32,999
came before Mother Mary’s holy presence, looked upon Mother once, and even before taking the Covenant, surrendered herself completely to Mother in prayer.

151
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:43,999
In those very moments, she received a great healing, as Mother extended her powerful hand to bring life back.

152
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:53,999
This was the first testimony the daughter shared. The second was a difficulty that accompanied the illness—constantly spitting saliva.

153
00:18:54,000 --> 00:19:03,999
She was struggling because she was unable to swallow it. The daughter testified that after taking the Covenant, she took a token to see Father.

154
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:16,999
And when Father was praying here, during the laying-on-of-hands prayer, without saying anything, Father directly anointed his thumb and traced the sign of the cross three times on the mother’s throat.

155
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:30,999
At that very moment, the sister felt as if something heavy left her body. From that day until now, she has received complete deliverance from the habit of constantly spitting.

156
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:38,999
All medicines were stopped, and without taking any medicine at all, the mother regained normal health—this is what is being testified.

157
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:47,999
Both of these affirm the same words that we often read in the Kreupasanam newspaper: “Covenant life brings immediate solutions.”

158
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:50,999
This daughter is testifying to that very truth at this altar.

159
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:58,999
She came near Mother Mary, looked upon her just once, and in that pure devotion and total surrender, with tears,

160
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:08,999
having nowhere else to go and considering Mother’s presence as the final refuge—otherwise only death remained—she entrusted her life completely.

161
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:26,999
And the daughter testifies how the Holy Mother transformed this mother into health and protection. We often see that those who take the Covenant are always assured of the protection of angels.

162
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:38,999
That protection is experienced personally—through messages, through dreams, through signs and proofs, and through guidance for the path ahead.

163
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:47,999
The daughter also says that when she went into the exam hall, she realized that there was no photo pasted on the hall ticket and no gazetted officer’s signature.

164
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:57,999
The moment she came to know this through others, she shared all the distress of that situation.

165
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:06,999
With no transport available, standing by a roadside where only an occasional vehicle passes, not knowing what to do, and almost certain of losing the exam,

166
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:11,999
a person stopped an auto. Then, treating her like his own, he took her, got the photo taken,

167
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:16,999
took her to a school to get it attested, and brought her before the exam time.

168
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:25,999
He made sure she could write the exam. The daughter repeatedly says that it was the auto driver sent by Mother Mary, because in Covenant life,

169
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:35,999
We are able to recognize it like this: when our entire life is in crisis, when there seems to be no way forward and we feel completely stuck,

170
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:44,999
Mother opens new paths for us. She brings new people into our lives and helps us overcome our difficulties.

171
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:49,999
This is the testimony that the daughter accepted and shared here at this altar.

172
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:58,999
In all the daughter’s words, there is pure and innocent love for Mother. The entire family spoke, each one with great humility,

173
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:17,999
sharing through testimony how Mother entered their lives—lives of tears, lives of loneliness, lives of sorrow, lives of illness— and how she brought comfort, joy, and hope.

174
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:32,999
In the place of the Holy Mother’s apparition, whenever we offer an intention, if we are also ready to surrender our lives along with that intention,

175
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:39,999
Mother remains with us, giving signs that always lead us into divine blessings and reminding us of her presence.

176
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:44,999
The children testify that they experienced Mother’s divine presence in this family during all their times of suffering.

177
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:55,999
Even in the drainage issue, when everyone else stepped back, one person came forward, took upon himself all the hardship, and helped that family—this too the sister pointed out.

178
00:22:56,000 --> 00:23:05,999
Dearly beloved, this family strongly testifies that no matter what danger we fall into, the Holy Mother will stand with us, send angels, and protect our lives.

179
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:18,999
Just as Mother Mary told the servants in John 2:5, “Do whatever He tells you,” and when the servants acted, it became a blessing,

180
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:26,999
in the same way, when we decide to live by doing whatever is told to us in the Covenant, divine solutions come upon our life situations.

181
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:33,999
We will experience blessings that we ourselves never expected—Mother obtaining them for us and placing them into our hands.

182
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:40,999
These are the beautiful faith testimonies that this family has shared before us.

183
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:51,999
Giving thanks for all the blessings, realizations, and the protection of Mother Mary received in this family, let us offer this testimony with applause.

184
00:23:52,000 --> 00:24:03,999
Extraordinary divine experiences can be yours too, if you have not yet subscribed to this YouTube channel, subscribe right now.

185
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:08,000
By sharing this video with your friends, become missionaries of the Lord.
